{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/sc/web_table.html?id=340-45022&api_popup=1"},"title":"港元利息结算率","tablenote":["港元利息结算率由香港银行公会提供及拥有。每日港元利息结算率是根据香港银行公会港元利率套戥协议条款，按香港银行同业市场港元存款的市场利率来厘定。香港银行公会一般会在每个营业日（星期六除外）早上 11 时 15 分在其网站上发布该天港元利息结算率，并以香港银行公会指定的 12 至 20 间参考银行所提供的报价资料作为厘定基础。计算方法是从参考银行的报价中剔除最高与最低各三个报价，然后取其平均数。     数字会根据认可机构所提交的修订资料而作出按月修订。","N.A. 没有数字"],"source":"香港金融管理局 如欲获取更多资料，请浏览香港金融管理局网站(www.hkma.gov.hk/chi)。 (查询电话：2878 8222  查询电邮：hkma@hkma.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":20}},"dataSet":[{"MATURITY":"0N","MATURITYDesc":"隔夜","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"1M","MATURITYDesc":"1 个月","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.48,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"1W","MATURITYDesc":"1星期","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"3M","MATURITYDesc":"3 个月","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.61,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"6M","MATURITYDesc":"6 个月","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.7,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"0N","MATURITYDesc":"隔夜","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"1M","MATURITYDesc":"1 个月","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.46,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"1W","MATURITYDesc":"1星期","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"3M","MATURITYDesc":"3 个月","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.64,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"6M","MATURITYDesc":"6 个月","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.88,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"0N","MATURITYDesc":"隔夜","freq":"Y","period":"2025","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","f